From 1cdd2dbb18a417bcd7642f8588d0cae9d5a630d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tyler South <tsouth2@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:56:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 148/150] Report a slow compositor as busy during package
 updates

A large package update on CPU rendering can keep Hyprland from answering
the health probe for minutes. The launcher then offered to restart, which
would cut pacman off mid-transaction (#359). While pacman holds its lock
and is running, the probe now reports busy instead of unresponsive.
Revision 63 delivers the helper to existing disks.
